    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. Well, I understand that too. And, you know, I think a lot of us on the Republican side of between Iraq and hard place, but we're really not because as Republicans, we're for pro life. We're for the Constitution, and we are strong for the military. I hadn't figured out yet what the Democrats are strong on. I know they're strong on just squeezing the life out of our country because every decision I've been in three years that I've been here has been detrimental to the citizens and Americans in the United States and America. It is absolutely strangling the life out of what our parents and great grandparents have built.",
