    "turn_text": "Yeah. And you brought it up. You have to have good staffers. It's it's it you really do because there's so many things that that hearings you have to go to so many Things on your plate, you know, it's not like offense defense and kicking game at football I mean, there's 15 20 different items every day that you got to pay attention to but we jumped in on this one just to bring to light You know how bad this administration is in terms of the Constitution they could care less and again, it goes back to a executive overreach here and if we continue to allow this to happen my gosh where's this country headed and uh... you know just it concerns me that uh... that they're squeezing a life out of this country every day. And this is not a small thing, this is a big thing, but there's a lot of these big things that's going to overshadow our country as we go along.",
